WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:06.640
Surrounded by Shi Lang's massive host, the defenders of Geyang had already held out for six grueling days.

00:06.720 --> 00:07.400
Here

00:07.480 --> 00:08.720
These inconspicuous places in the city

00:08.800 --> 00:10.080
Can all have ambushes set

00:10.160 --> 00:11.400
If street fighting breaks out

00:11.560 --> 00:13.560
Can greatly slow the enemy's advance

00:15.000 --> 00:16.400
Report

00:16.840 --> 00:17.440
The Wuzhao

00:17.520 --> 00:18.920
The Wuzhao have withdrawn

00:19.000 --> 00:19.960
Withdrawn

00:20.040 --> 00:20.840
How is that possible?

00:20.960 --> 00:21.600
Absolutely true

00:21.680 --> 00:22.400
Their army has already

00:22.480 --> 00:23.880
Started moving

00:25.320 --> 00:25.920
Let's go

00:26.000 --> 00:27.400
To see

00:37.880 --> 00:38.520
Could it be

00:38.600 --> 00:40.560
Our volunteers have come to help

00:40.640 --> 00:42.280
Shilang thinks Yiyang

00:42.360 --> 00:43.880
Is a tough nut to crack

00:43.960 --> 00:45.960
And is preparing to attack elsewhere

00:46.640 --> 00:48.000
No

00:48.080 --> 00:49.480
More likely

00:49.880 --> 00:51.240
Reinforcements have arrived

00:51.320 --> 00:52.200
Shilang

00:52.320 --> 00:53.680
Plans to besiege and attack reinforcements

00:53.760 --> 00:55.760
The Wuzhao made no moves yesterday

00:55.960 --> 00:56.440
Perhaps

00:56.520 --> 00:57.360
They were planning

00:57.440 --> 00:58.280
To turn their spears

00:58.360 --> 01:00.027
To fully attack the reinforcements

01:00.640 --> 01:02.000
Any news of reinforcements lately?

01:02.080 --> 01:03.600
The scouts we sent out

01:03.680 --> 01:05.080
None have returned

01:07.480 --> 01:08.680
Your Highness

01:08.760 --> 01:09.760
The reinforcements are rushing

01:09.920 --> 01:11.320
Likely can't maintain formation

01:11.400 --> 01:12.480
If they engage on the plains now

01:12.640 --> 01:14.480
Rushing into battle with Wuzhao cavalry

01:14.560 --> 01:16.240
I'm afraid they won't survive two charges

01:16.320 --> 01:17.987
And will be completely routed

01:20.000 --> 01:21.040
Your general requests to fight

01:21.120 --> 01:22.120
If we go out now

01:22.200 --> 01:22.960
And form with the reinforcements

01:23.040 --> 01:23.840
A pincer attack

01:23.920 --> 01:25.040
Then we have a chance

01:25.120 --> 01:26.680
What if reinforcements haven't come?

01:26.760 --> 01:29.093
Aren't you just delivering us to Shilang?

01:30.760 --> 01:32.040
The cooking fires in the Wuzhao camp

01:32.200 --> 01:33.600
Haven't decreased

01:34.000 --> 01:35.680
If they really plan to leave

01:35.760 --> 01:37.160
Why light fires?

01:38.040 --> 01:39.680
This is just a diversion

01:39.760 --> 01:41.600
Should we wait for them to destroy the reinforcements

01:41.680 --> 01:43.040
Then return to rest and attack the city?

01:43.200 --> 01:44.600
You

01:45.120 --> 01:46.520
Please, Your Highness, decide

